sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant L as Lead
  participant B as Bridge send 路由
  participant DB as founder_ask 表
  participant DC as Discord thread
  participant R as 标题刷新器
  participant D as founder 回帖扫描器
  participant F as founder
  L->>B: POST /api/chat-threads/send + founderAsk
  B->>DB: 先写一行(message_id 空)
  B->>DC: 发消息
  DC-->>B: 消息 id
  B->>DB: 回填 message_id,记事件 founder_ask_lit
  B->>R: 触发刷新
  R->>DC: 标题改为 🔔要你答
  F->>DC: 在 thread 回一句
  D->>DC: 读新消息,作者 = founder
  D->>DB: settle(settled_by = founder_reply),记事件 founder_ask_settled
  D->>R: 触发刷新
  R->>DC: 标题回到原阶段词
